  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Water from a tap emerges vertically downwards with an initial velocity <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>V</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></math>. Assuming pressure is constant throughout the stream of water and the flow is steady, find the distance from the tap at which cross-sectional area of the stream is half of the cross-sectional area of the stream at the tap.</p>\r"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msubsup><mi>V</mi><mn>0</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>g</mi></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><msubsup><mi>V</mi><mn>0</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>g</mi></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msubsup><mi>V</mi><mn>0</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow><mi>g</mi></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn><msubsup><mi>V</mi><mn>0</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>g</mi></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "B"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\st0061_1a0a7d756e81.png\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" /><br /><br />Using the 3rd equation of motion<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>V</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>u</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>g</mi><mi>h</mi></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>V</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msqrt><msubsup><mi>V</mi><mn>0</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>g</mi><mi>h</mi></msqrt></math><br /><br />Using the equation of continuity<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>V</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>V</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math><br /><br />we get <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>V</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><msqrt><msubsup><mi>V</mi><mn>0</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>g</mi><mi>h</mi></msqrt></mfrac></math><br /><br />Required condition <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>V</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><msqrt><msubsup><mi>V</mi><mn>0</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>g</mi><mi>h</mi></msqrt></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>4</mn><msubsup><mi>V</mi><mn>0</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mi>V</mi><mn>0</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>g</mi><mi>h</mi></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>h</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><msubsup><mi>V</mi><mn>0</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>g</mi></mrow></mfrac></math>"
  }
}